mpic weightlifting gold medal equalled the mark set by Turkey’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/56874"} "Naim Süleymanoğlu"] " in 1988-96, although it would later be equalled in Sydney by Dimas’ teammate " [:a {:href "/athletes/55887"} "Akakios Kakiasvili"] ", and in 2004 by Turkey’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/56868"} "Halil Mutlu"] ". Only Dimas and Süleymanoğlu won their three gold medals in the same class. Dimas returned in 2004 and won a bronze medal in the light-heavyweight class, his fourth Olympic weightlifting medal equalling the mark set by American " [:a {:href "/athletes/57018"} "Norb Schemansky"] " (1948-64) and German " [:a {:href "/athletes/55874"} "Ronny Weller"] " in Sydney (1988-2000), but Dimas is the only Olympic weightlifter to win four medals in the same class."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Kilograms"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/55879"} "Pyrros Dimas"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GRE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GRE.png"}] "GRE"]] [:td {} "390.0"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/55830"} "Marc Huster"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "390.0"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/94727"} "Giorgi Asanidze"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GEO"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-